      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_1",
          "text": "Joshua\u2019s commission is framed by both presence and obedience. The repeated call to courage is tied to the assurance that God will be with Joshua, while \u201cgood success\u201d is tied to keeping, speaking, meditating on, and doing the law Moses gave. Leadership in this chapter is therefore not presented as courage alone, but as courage shaped by faithful attention to Torah.",
