      "title": "The Book\u2019s Movement",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_2",
          "text": "Joshua 1 begins the book\u2019s larger movement: succession after Moses and entry into the land lead into campaigns, the allotment of land, questions of tribal unity, Joshua\u2019s farewell, and covenant renewal. This opening commission introduces a book concerned with Israel\u2019s entry and life in the land rather than with later figures and settings such as David, Solomon, the monarchy, exile, Jerusalem, or Samaria.",
